Package: CGLBM
Title: Censored Gaussian Latent Block Models for Co-Clustering
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(
      person("Kejun", "Fang",
             email = "kejun.fang@mail.mcgill.ca",
             role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Qihuang", "Zhang",
             email = "qihuang.zhang@mcgill.ca",
             role = "aut")
    )
Description: Fits Gaussian latent block models to matrices containing exact,
    left-censored, right-censored, interval-censored, and missing reports.
    The package jointly estimates row and column memberships with block means
    and variances using the reported-data likelihood, supports hard and soft
    membership updates, selects row and column class numbers using a
    Bayesian-information-criterion approximation to the integrated
    classification likelihood, and reports block-mean standard errors from
    Fisher information under fixed reporting rules. Completion-based
    comparators and censoring-aware column centering are also provided.
